5  | Authentication probe passed, no expiry                            | per id                              | writeProbe -> PROBE_OK|PROBE_FAIL <id>, probes.tsv; STOP_AUTH
6  | No deviation from the preregistered command                       | per id                              | writeCmd -> CMD <id> <sha256 of argv>
7  | Oracle score recoverable                                          | per id, after the run               | writeScore -> SCORE <id> m1 m2 m3 or SCORE_MISSING <id>
8  | At least 27 of 30 completed five turns, in each arm separately    | per id and end                      | writeTurns -> TURNS <id> arm n; COMPLETE ON=x/N C=y/N
9  | Single resolved model id                                          | per id                              | writeModel -> MODEL <id> <value>
10 | Hook active only in ON runs, and only the gate hook               | per id                              | writeHookCount -> HOOKCOUNT <id> gate_trace gate_log plugin (+ HOOKERR)
11 | Blocks per turn never exceed N                                    | per id                              | writeBlockMax -> BLOCKMAX <id> <value> from the hook log
12 | Interleaving order as preregistered (D2)                          | per id                              | writeOrder -> ORDER <id> <arm> before the call
13 | Cost within the cap                                               | per id                              | writeCost -> COSTCHK before, COST <id> run probe running projected after, per arm; STOP_COST
14 | Preregistration committed earlier                                 | before first call                   | writePrereg -> PREREG <hash> <time> ancestor=yes|no, HASH lines
